      "writtenOn": "2024-12-06T21:11:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you could probably replace `plug_insert_or_removal` with the UCSI interrupt to retain the same behavior for other tests. Setting that bit would cause us to call get_connector_status again but not update the connection status change bits.\n\nWRT/ sink_ready, I believe Alex said it would be emitted when PS_READY is sent as part of PD. So setting this as a result of set_connector_status where pwr_direction changes to SNK is probably a good enough approximation.",
